x52pro
------------------------------------------
User-space library and tools to control the Multi-Function Display (MFD) and
LEDs on Saitek X52 and X52 Pro joysticks.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libusb1.0-1.0.21-1
  libusb1.0-devel-1.0.21-1
  libx52pro-devel-0.2.0-1bl1
  libx52pro0-0.2.0-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.11-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.13-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libusb1.0-devel-1.0.21-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/seesturm/x52lib

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/seesturm/x52lib/archive/refs/tags/v0.2.0.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack x52pro-0.2.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./x52pro-0.2.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/x52pro-0.2.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/x52pro-0.2.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libx52pro0-0.2.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libx52pro-devel-0.2.0-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(x52pro)
  /usr/bin/x52output.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/x52pro.README
  /usr/share/doc/x52pro/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/x52pro/README
  /usr/share/doc/x52pro/changelog
  /usr/share/man/man1/x52output.1.gz
  /usr/share/metainfo/at.hasenleithner.plasma.x52pro.metainfo.xml

(libx52pro0)
  /usr/bin/cygx52pro-0.dll

(libx52pro-devel)
  /usr/include/x52pro.h
  /usr/lib/libx52pro.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/x52pro.pc

